---

🏔️ MountainVerse

Main Concept

MountainVerse DreamVerse ka ek large, explorable mountain-based World Area hoga.

Environment

- Huge mountains
- Mountain valleys
- Forest areas
- Rivers
- Waterfalls
- Caves
- Climbing/exploration paths
- Mountain viewpoints
- High-altitude locations
- Different mountain levels

Mountain Village

Mountain area ke lower section me ek large village hoga.

Village me:

- Houses
- Small shops
- Local NPCs
- Roads
- Food places
- Community locations
- Mountain-life activities

Lowest area intentionally neutral rahega. Yahan religious landmark nahi hoga.

Temple Areas

Mountain ke different levels par temples ke areas ho sakte hain.

Har temple area ke aas-paas:

- Small settlement/village
- Walking paths
- Scenic locations
- Local NPCs
- Exploration points

Religious locations ko respectfully design kiya jayega. Real-world religious places ko exact copy nahi kiya jayega; inspiration lekar original DreamVerse versions banaye jayenge.

Famous Mountain Locations

MountainVerse me environment ke according famous/interesting real-world places se inspiration lekar original landmarks/buildings/cities banaye ja sakte hain.

Exact buildings abhi decide nahi hue hain.

Highest Area

MountainVerse ke highest point par DreamVerse ka fictional Heaven-like mystical area ho sakta hai.

Ye kisi real religion ke Heaven ko exactly represent nahi karega. Ye DreamVerse ka fictional location hoga.

Exploration

MountainVerse me multiple routes honge:

- Normal paths
- Mountain trails
- Climbing routes
- Bridges
- Caves
- Hidden paths
- High-altitude routes

Goal: player ko mountain ko genuinely explore karne ka reason mile.

