🏜️ DesertVerse

Main Concept

DesertVerse DreamVerse ka ek large, explorable desert-based World Area hoga.

Environment

- Huge sand dunes
- Rocky desert
- Dry valleys
- Canyons
- Oasis
- Desert caves
- Long desert roads
- Ancient-looking ruins
- Remote settlements
- Hidden exploration locations

Desert Settlements

Different parts of the desert me villages/settlements ho sakte hain.

Inme:

- Houses
- Markets
- Local shops
- Water/oasis locations
- NPCs
- Desert transportation
- Rest areas

Famous Desert Locations

DesertVerse me famous real-world desert buildings, ruins, landmarks ya cities se inspiration lekar original DreamVerse versions banaye ja sakte hain.

Exact buildings/cities abhi decide nahi hue hain.

Exploration

Player desert me:

- Dunes cross karega
- Oasis discover karega
- Caves explore karega
- Ancient ruins discover karega
- Remote settlements tak jayega
- Hidden locations find karega

Day/Night

Desert ka daytime aur nighttime environment noticeably different feel karega.

