🏗️ Building Rule

MountainVerse aur DesertVerse ke andar future me environment ke according interesting/famous buildings, landmarks ya cities ke original versions banaye ja sakte hain.

Real-world locations se inspiration allowed hai, lekin exact copying nahi.

Final Structure

DreamVerse World Areas:

